# Donate

{% textSize textSize="large" inline=false _language="" %}We are a small but mighty team of public health experts, researchers and digital strategists dedicated to changing the landscape of abortion in the US. Your generous donations make our work possible.‍{% /textSize %}

{% textSize textSize="large" inline=false _language="" %}Plan C is a fiscally sponsored project of NEO Philanthropy, a US 501(c)3 nonprofit (EIN 13-3191113) . All donations are to NEO Philanthropy, and are tax-deductible to the extent of the law.{% /textSize %}

{% textSize textSize="large" inline=false _language="" %}To contact us directly, email us at {% inlineLink action={discriminant: "mailto", value: "support@plancpills.org"} _language="" %}support@plancpills.org{% /inlineLink %}.{% /textSize %}

